nsufficient scientists (either due to exclusion rules or inability to form pairs), so they are invalid.\n\n3. **Second Year Constraints:**\n   - Chair must be a first-year member except H.\n   - Valid first-year members (excluding H): F, V, Z.\n\n4. **Evaluating Options:**\n   - **A) F:** Valid (was in the first year).\n   - **B) G:** Not in first year (invalid).\n   - **C) Y:** Excluded by H in first year (invalid).\n   - **D) I:** Not in first year (invalid).\n\n**Conclusion:** The only valid option is **A) F**.",
