* discusses profits, irrelevant to technical validity.\n- **C** mentions a \"small number\" of laptops with CPU/memory issues, which does not refute that most issues stem from hard disks. \n\nThus, **D** directly questions the causal link between SSD replacement and improved gaming performance. \n\n**Answer: D**",
