      "text": " A) Innovation drive contains unlimited potential.\n\nWait, the problem is that \"unlimited potential\" might not be directly stated, but the examples show that innovation is being applied in various new areas (like during the pandemic), so it's demonstrating that it can keep providing new solutions, which implies potential. So A might be the best.\n\nAlternatively, B talks about a new world of science and tech, but the passage's main thrust is economic growth and social impact, not just tech's new world.\n\nHmm, maybe B is incorrect because the \"new world of economic growth\" is mentioned, but the title options don't have that exactly. So perhaps A is better as it's a more general statement about potential, which aligns with the continuous injection of momentum and overcoming challenges through innovation.\n\nAlternatively, maybe C is too narrow because it only mentions social life, but the passage also covers economic aspects. So the best answer is A.\n</think>\n\nA) Innovation drive contains unlimited potential\n\nThe passage emphasizes that China's innovation-driven strategy has continuously injected new momentum into high-quality development and opened new economic growth opportunities. Even amid the pandemic, innovation demonstrated its value through technological advancements (e.g., vaccine research, telecommuting, contactless services), which not only addressed immediate challenges but also reshaped social and economic systems. While options B and C focus on specific aspects (science/tech or social life), the overarching theme highlights innovation\u2019s **ongoing and expansive potential** to drive progress across multiple domains. The phrase \"unlimited potential\" in Option A captures this broader, forward-looking emphasis, aligning with the text\u2019s focus on sustained contributions and adaptability. Option D\u2019s mention of \"rapid development\" is less precise, as the passage prioritizes \"high-quality\" growth over speed. Thus, **A** best encapsulates the passage\u2019s central idea.",
