messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nInternet addiction refers to a mental behavior disorder caused by an individual's repeated excessive use of the Internet, which is manifested as a strong desire to use the Internet again, and withdrawal reactions when stopping or reducing Internet use, and may be accompanied by mental and physical symptoms.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is Internet addiction?\n# Options:\nA) Xiaoli processes text materials online every day, and now she hardly uses paper and pens\nB) Xiao wang likes online games. he spends all day and night in internet cafes. if he doesn't use the internet for a day, he feels like he's lost his soul\nC) After the internet company went bankrupt, the engineer xiao li was desperate and didn't know what he could do\nD) Mr. li is keen on stock speculation. he watches the stock market on the internet every day, and he feels uneasy all day without looking at it", '<think>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
