d poplar planting) that altered habitats to favor rats, reinforcing the expert\u2019s viewpoint.  \n\n**C** stands out because it points to natural climatic conditions rather than ecological destruction as the cause, thereby not supporting the expert\u2019s argument.  \n\n**Answer: C**",
