which the argument does not hinge on.  \n- **B** compares regions rather than showing a temporal cause-effect in the same region.  \n- **C** focuses on snowpack size, which is unrelated to the argument\u2019s emphasis on melting timing and precipitation form.  \n\n**Answer: D**",
