ic motivation.That's internal drive, so again, maybe field-independent.Field-dependent people might be more externally motivated.\nOption B suggests relying on others' evaluations, indicating a strong tendency to be influenced by external opinions, contrary to field dependence.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
