citly address.  \n- **Option D** is contradicted by the passage, as \"advanced culture\" is criticized for being disconnected.  \n- **Option C** aligns perfectly with the idea of rural culture being grounded in its own local conditions, ensuring it remains connected to and integrated with the society's reality.",
