er, LZ\u2019s vote for ZJ forces WM to vote for ZJ only, leaving LZ\u2019s vote count insufficient for a full vote. Thus, LZ votes for WM (since WM lacks a full vote) but not for himself, while WM votes only for ZJ.\n\n### Conclusion:\n- **Wang Ming did not vote for Li Zilu** (as WM only voted for ZJ).\n- **Li Zilu voted for Wang Ming** (since WM didn\u2019t receive a full vote).\n\nThus, the correct answer is **D**.\n\n**Answer: D**",
