messages:   95%|#########5| 570/600 [6:00:19<09:22, 18.74s/it][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nSince the founding of new China, China's higher education mechanism has changed several times, but it is basically managed by the government. Over the past ten years of reform and opening up, the reform of higher education system has taken important steps and made great achievements. However, on the whole, it still lags behind the process of economic system reform and social development.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following arguments does the above paragraph mainly support?\n# Options:\nA) China's higher education system needs supporting reform to adapt to economic system reform and social development.\nB) Since the reform and opening up, china's higher education system reform has made great achievements.\nC) The original higher education system has never adapted to the needs of social development.\nD) Since the founding of new china, china's higher education system has undergone many changes.", '<think>\nOkay, let\'s tackle this problem.The question is asking which argument the given paragraph mainly supports.The options are A, B, C, or D. .\n\nFirst, I need to understand the context provided.The paragraph talks about China\'s higher education system since the founding of the People\'s Republic.It mentions that there have been several changes, but it\'s mostly government-managed.Over the past ten years of reform and opening up, there have been important steps and great achievements in higher education reform.However, the key point here is the last sentence: "on the whole, it still lags behind the process of economic system reform and social development.".\n\nSo the main idea is that while there have been reforms and achievements, the higher education system is still not keeping up with economic and social changes.The paragraph isn\'t just stating that reforms happened (which is in option B) or that there were many changes (option D).It\'s pointing out a deficiency in relation to economic and social development.\n\nLooking at the options:.\n\nA) Suggests that higher education needs reform to adapt to economic and social changes.This aligns with the last sentence of the paragraph, which says it\'s lagging behind those areas..\nThe paragraph primarily focuses on the advancements made since 1949, highlighting progress rather than any shortcomings or lack of progress.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
