ative outcome (antipathy).  \n- **Option D** directly links repeated ads to viewer boredom/anger and antipathy toward the product, aligning perfectly with the context\u2019s conclusion that repetition caused harm.  \n\n**Answer: D**  \nRepeated playback of the same ad will cause TV viewers to get bored or even angry, and thus have a strong antipathy to the products that the merchant is trying to promote.",
